# Production environment for the Vercel-hosted frontend.
# Copy this to `.env.production` for local production builds, and set the same
# value as a Vercel Environment Variable (Production) in the project settings.
#
# In dev, leave this unset: Vite proxies /api to http://localhost:5000.
# In production, point it at your deployed Render API, including the /api/v1
# version segment. The host must be the service's EXACT primary URL, copied from
# the Render deploy log's "==> Available at your primary URL ..." line -- Render
# appends a suffix such as "-0bon" when the requested service name is taken, e.g.
#   https://acc-app-api-0bon.onrender.com/api/v1
VITE_API_URL=https://acc-app-api-0bon.onrender.com/api/v1
